        "text": "Security update for opensc",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for opensc fixes the following issues\n\n- CVE-2026-10275: global buffer overflow during key pair generation tests due to missing input validation (bsc#1267246).\n- CVE-2026-40528: stack and heap buffer overrun in the `do_key_value()` function due to missing length check allows for\n  memory corruption via a crafted profile configuration file (bsc#1266963).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
